  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>Plate &amp; Bar is an app that is still in development and not yet released. Contact details will be added here before launch.</p>

  <h2>Data we expect to handle</h2>
  <p>Account details (such as email address), your setup answers and health-check answers, body measurements (weight and tape measurements), and the meal and workout information you choose to enter in the app. This is saved on your phone first and synced to our server when you are online.</p>
  <p>Progress photos, cycle data and lab results stay on your device and are never sent to the server.</p>

  <h2>Purpose, retention, your rights and deletion</h2>
  <p>To be written with legal review, including notice and consent, your rights as a data principal, grievance redressal, retention, and how to delete your account and data.</p>
